# Flash Sale Stock Model

Co the ton tai 3 muc stock:

\\	ext
product_variants.stock_quantity     # base stock (seller quan ly)
flash_sale_items.allocated_stock    # da allocate cho slot
flash_sale_items.available_stock    # con ban duoc trong slot (Redis mirror)
\
Day la **operational/materialized state** phuc vu Flash Sale va khong tu dong duoc xem la vi pham 3NF.

## Invariants

\\	ext
0 <= available_stock <= allocated_stock
allocated_stock <= product_variants.stock_quantity (tai thoi diem approve)
\
- Seller **khong duoc giam** base stock xuong duoi phan stock dang allocate cho Flash Sale dang ACTIVE.
- Optimistic lock @Version tren ProductVariant bao ve update dong thoi.
